@startuml post-withdraw
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/v1/user/withdraw
caption CRB-10 · 회원 탈퇴: 로그인 수단 · 개인정보 삭제 후 soft delete

actor Client
participant "AnyStatusGuard" as Guard
participant "UserController" as Controller
participant "UserService" as Service
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepository
participant "UserOauthAccountRepository" as UserOauthAccountRepository
participant "RefreshTokenRepository" as RefreshTokenRepository
participant "CoffeeChatContactRepository" as CoffeeChatContactRepository
participant "StudentRepository" as StudentRepository
participant "StudentEmailVerificationRepository" as StudentEmailVerificationRepository
participant "GraduatedRepository" as GraduatedRepository
database PostgreSQL
participant "S3"

Client -> Guard: POST /api/v1/user/withdraw\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
ref over Client, Guard: authenticate() — flow/auth-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token
note right of Guard: 가입 중(pending)인 유저도 탈퇴 가능
Guard -> Controller: withdraw(user)
Controller -> Service: withdraw(userCtx)

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> UserRepository: findByPkForUpdate(userPk, tx)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT users (is_deleted = false) FOR UPDATE
  note right
    다른 기기의 동시 로그인이 탈퇴 뒤에 토큰을 새로 만들지 않도록 잠금
    (로그인도 같은 유저 행을 FOR UPDATE로 잠금)
  end note
  PostgreSQL --> UserRepository: row
  UserRepository --> Service: user | null
  alt 유저 없음 (이미 탈퇴)
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 401 User not found
  end

  Service -> UserOauthAccountRepository: deleteByUserPk(pk, tx)
  UserOauthAccountRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE user_oauth_account
  note right: hard delete라 같은 OAuth 계정으로 다시 가입 가능
  Service -> AuthService: revokeAllTokens(pk, tx)
  AuthService -> RefreshTokenRepository: deleteByUserPk(pk, tx)
  RefreshTokenRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE refresh_token
  Service -> CoffeeChatContactRepository: deleteByUserPk(pk, tx)
  CoffeeChatContactRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE coffee_chat_contact (연락 이메일 · 전화번호)

  alt type = student
    Service -> StudentRepository: findByUserPk(pk, tx)
    opt 재학생 행이 있음
      Service -> StudentEmailVerificationRepository: deleteByStudentPk(studentPk, tx)
      StudentEmailVerificationRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE student_email_verification
      note right: 진행 중인 인증 요청에도\n입력한 gist 이메일이 남아 있음
      Service -> StudentRepository: clearEmailByUserPk(pk, tx)
      StudentRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE student SET email = NULL
      note right: UQ를 풀어 같은 gist 이메일로 재가입 가능
    end
  else type = graduated
    Service -> GraduatedRepository: findByUserPk(pk, tx)
    opt business_card_key가 있음
      Service -> GraduatedRepository: clearBusinessCardKey(graduatedPk, tx)
      GraduatedRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE graduated SET business_card_key = NULL
    end
  end

  Service -> UserRepository: withdraw(pk, tx)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE users SET is_deleted = true, name = NULL, email = NULL
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL
  트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답.
  남기는 것: 약관 동의 이력, student / graduated · 프로필 행, 커피챗 요청(공유된 연락처 포함)과 알림 로그
  — 상대방의 커피챗 기록이 참조함
end note

opt 명함 key를 지웠음
  Service -> S3: deleteFile(businessCardKey)
  alt S3 삭제 실패
    note over Service, S3: 로그만 남기고 계속 진행 (DB에는 이미 참조가 없음)
  end
end

Service --> Controller: BaseResultDto.OK
Controller --> Client: 201 { result: "OK" }
note right of Client
  이미 발급된 access token은 만료(기본 1시간)까지 UserGuard를 통과할 수 있음.
  DB를 보는 GET /user/info · 가입 단계 API는 401 User not found
end note

@enduml
